WEBVTT

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.860
Welcome to the Hidden Leaf Village.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:37.160
The village where, as we all know,
Naruto Uzumaki makes his home.

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:41.820
But he isn't actually the
main character this time.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:42.800
Caw-haw, caw-haw...

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:49.500
Go away!

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:53.630
Hand over the money, now.

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.740
Give it up and no one gets hurt.

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.600
We got her to borrow it 
just like we planned!

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:58.340
Stop it...

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:00.710
Fork over the money, now!

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:02.640
Give it up and this'll all be over.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.260
We'll make her pay it back 
just like we planned!

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:05.440
Stay back!

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:08.010
Make with the money, now!

00:02:08.010 --> 00:02:10.240
Give it up and we'll leave you alone.

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:12.410
We'll get away with it 
just like we planned!

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:13.760
That's enough!

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:14.660
Huh?

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:15.480
Who's there?

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:23.490
When are you criminals going 
to learn your lesson?

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:25.080
Who are you?

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:29.580
I would love to say that 
I need no introduction,

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.170
but it's proper etiquette to give 
one's name to one's opponent,

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.650
no matter what manner of 
evildoer they may be.

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.510
Very well, I will tell you!

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:37.510
<b>DANGER
Be bright, turn to the right!</b>

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.460
I hate crooked things!

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:42.260
My favorite words are:

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:44.100
<b>Ta-da! I ate the whole thing!</b>

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:44.100
Effort...

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.510
...and guts!

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:48.100
I'm a ninja who lives for my love!

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:50.390
My name...

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:55.670
...is Rock Lee!

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:59.900
<b>Rock Lee is 
a Ninja Who Can't Use Ninjutsu</b>

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.530
Caw-haw, caw-haw...

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.320
It's a fight!

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:09.900
I won't stand by while three adults
assault a helpless little girl!

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.780
What? This is none of 
your business, pal.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.150
You wouldn't be saying that 
if you knew who we were.

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:17.020
You're gonna get hurt.

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:18.960
We warned him good, 
just like we planned.

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:21.010
You leave me no choice.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:24.260
If I can't convince you with my words, 
I'll do it with my fists.

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.430
What'd he say?

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:30.990
Poopie!

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:47.070
Poopie?!

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:05.430
Nice undies, Boss!

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:07.160
The sneak peek makes you look sexier.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:09.640
You jerk, I'll get you for this!

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.650
That ninja is awesome!

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:13.440
He just had a lucky trip.

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:17.940
All according to plan.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:21.040
That particular move allows 
me to resolve a situation...

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.200
...without any unnecessary bloodshed.

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:27.320
<b>Elimination by Depantsification</b>

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:27.300
The Elimination by Depantsification!

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.220
No way, he just made that up!

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:31.330
He even yelled when he almost 
stepped in the dog doo!

00:04:31.610 --> 00:04:34.710
You beat the bad guys without 
having to hurt anyone!

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:38.980
Once again, I have protected our village
without anyone getting hurt.

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:40.730
Give me your hand.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:41.290
Okay!

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:42.210
Oh, give me a break!

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.070
Tenten, Neji!

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.060
Why did you run off on your own?

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.950
We're supposed to act as a team.

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:56.650
You can't just take off.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:58.070
Now let's head back.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:02.360
I'm sorry, but could you 
all help me some more?

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.040
Huh?

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:06.850
Caw-haw, caw-haw...

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.460
Debt collectors?

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:10.340
Yes, they came after me because 
they want to make my dad...

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:11.870
...pay back the money he 
borrowed from them.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.330
Well, it's wrong to pick on the weak,

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.170
but people have an obligation 
to repay their debts, too.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.470
Well said!

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:22.250
A friend once told me that if you don't,

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.390
creditors will hound you day and night.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:29.020
<i>The DVD you rented, "After School 
Escapades," is now overdue.</i>

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:34.190
<i>The DVD you rented, "After School 
Ecstasy," is now overdue.</i>

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:37.020
<i>The DVD you rented, "After School 
Extreme," is now overdue.</i>

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:40.560
Don't bring up stuff like that!

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:42.870
Besides, that was your own experience!

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:43.840
Go on.

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:47.670
Of course my dad's working and 
intends to pay them back,

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:51.590
but those guys said if we didn't pay
back ten times what he owed,

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:53.410
they'd wreck our house!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:57.170
I see. So you've been 
swindled by a loan shark.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:06:02.040
That's why I came to this village
to hire a ninja to fight them off.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.860
But they caught me on the way.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.920
That's when your teammate saved me.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:09.800
<i>"Saved." Right...</i>

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:14.000
Please, Mister, please help me!

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:17.370
Understood. I'll figure something out!

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:19.400
Hold on, you're getting 
ahead of yourself, Lee.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.860
Yes, we've got missions, remember?

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:23.820
Someone in trouble sounds 
like a mission to me.

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:25.150
You mean it?

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:26.740
Of course!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.990
Just think of me as your hero 
riding in on a black horse!

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:32.060
It's a white horse, idiot!

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:34.010
Black horses are for the bad guys!

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:34.950
Interesting.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.330
Caw-haw, caw-haw...

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:42.190
Would you quit walking like that?

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:44.170
It's part of my training!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:46.420
That's it, we're here!

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:49.530
Ah, this is your house?

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:51.150
I need to use your bathroom!

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:53.070
Mister, be careful!

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:54.300
Did they set traps?

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:58.680
No, but a stray dog pooped 
in front of the door.

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:56.810
<b>Give us our money!</b>

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:07.450
Poopie?!

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:14.200
It was a close call, but I didn't touch it.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:17.870
That's the kind of display that makes 
you wonder if he's really a ninja.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.370
You're okay, right?

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:26.290
It looks like they've taken 
most of your things already.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:30.040
I'm sorry, they've shut off the 
electricity, gas, and water,

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:32.300
so I can only make plain tea.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.620
Wait, do we even have electricity 
and gas in this world?

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:38.860
It's fine, I'm a coffee drinker anyway.

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:41.290
That's not what I meant!

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:43.320
I'll pass on the tea as well.

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:44.910
I prefer high-quality green tea.

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:47.050
Not you, too!

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:50.410
Wait, Mister, you can use ninjutsu, right?

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:51.640
Like shooting fireballs?

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.070
You could heat up the tea kettle for us!

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.410
I'm afraid I can't do that.

00:07:56.400 --> 00:08:00.280
Of course, you're not supposed to use
ninjutsu for such silly things, right?

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:01.830
Well, yes, but...

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:06.210
I mean I can't use ninjutsu!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.910
What do you mean,
you can't use ninjutsu?!

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:14.740
You're a ninja, aren't you?

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:17.100
A ninja who can't use ninjutsu, yes.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.910
Then what was that jutsu...

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:20.970
...where you win without unnecessary
bloodshed or whatever?

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:22.370
Well, um...

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:23.930
I was embarrassed about falling down,

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:25.690
so I just kind of rolled with it.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:28.150
More like trolled with it, you klutz.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.240
Can't use ninjutsu...

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.440
But don't worry, I—

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:35.360
You said you'd figure 
something out! I trusted you!

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.870
A ninja who can't use ninjutsu is 
just a regular person!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.710
Oh, come on.

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:42.580
That's like saying a pig that 
can't fly is just a regular pig.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.960
Not even close.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:47.430
You big liar!

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:48.880
I'm not falling for your act again!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:53.100
I never lied to you, and I wasn't 
trying to trick you either.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:53.970
Besides...

00:08:57.740 --> 00:09:00.600
You decided to fall for me on your own.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:04.390
We're not in some sappy TV drama!

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:07.650
Wait, hear me out!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.050
Sure, I can't use ninjutsu, but—

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:11.480
Shut up! Go away!

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:14.940
Darn it.

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:17.570
Sounds like she doesn't want to hear it.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:18.660
I guess we'll have to give up.

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:21.460
Stupid meanies...

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.580
Again?!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.580
I said go away!

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:26.980
<b>Give us our money!</b>

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:29.430
Good afternoon, little lady.

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:32.780
That weirdo got in our way last time, 
but now the coast is clear.

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:34.980
It's time for the finale.

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:36.970
You've caused me enough grief.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:41.350
Oh well, at least this kid'll 
fetch a handsome sum. Bwahaha!

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:47.710
<i>I'm done for...</i>

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:49.980
Hold it right there!

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:51.440
That voice!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:52.210
It's him!

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:56.710
Villains who extort money from the weak,

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:57.980
if you don't want to get hurt—

00:09:57.980 --> 00:09:59.190
Ow, ow!

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:01.200
Then get away from that girl!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.920
What're you trying to pull?!

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:04.580
You can't even use ninjutsu!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.870
Like I said, if you'd just hear me out...

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:10.040
Ah, I thought you 
just tripped last time.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.060
Guess I was right!

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:14.560
If you can't use ninjutsu, 
we've got nothing to fear!

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:16.360
We'll get revenge just like we planned!

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:18.680
Get him, boys! Bwahaha!

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:22.110
It's true that I can't use ninjutsu.

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:23.140
However...

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:28.390
<b>Leaf Crap Shoot</b>

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:28.670
Leaf Crap Shoot!

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:35.400
<b>Morning Coffee</b>

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:34.880
Morning Coffee!

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:40.320
<b>Raining Nosebleed</b>

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:38.740
Raining Nosebleed!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.930
Not bad!

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.990
But you'll never beat me.

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.250
Bwahaha!

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.430
What're you doing? Run away!

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:54.040
Never.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:57.000
What now, Mr. Ninja who 
can't use ninjutsu?

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:57.920
Bwahaha!

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.990
You can't fight him.

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:04.070
A ninja who can't use ninjutsu 
is just an ordinary person.

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:05.260
You're wrong.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:09.590
Just an ordinary person? 
Nothing could be further from the truth.

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:10.640
Right.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:13.300
Lee isn't unique because 
he can't use ninjutsu,

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:15.230
or because of his hand-to-hand 
fighting skills.

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.740
What sets Lee apart from others 
is his unbreakable willpower.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:20.700
The will to never give up.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:23.030
You fool!

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:26.030
Take this!

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:29.960
You tripped yourself on purpose?!

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:36.110
<b>Elimination by Depantsification</b>

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:35.280
Elimination by Depantsification!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.980
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:44.130
Forget it, if we're just gonna 
get embarrassed like this,

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:48.130
we're never coming to this house again!

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.130
Boss!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.900
Sure, I can't use ninjutsu.

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:54.270
However...

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:58.150
Even without it, 
I aim to be a great ninja.

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:01.280
That's my goal in life!

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:04.380
Mister...

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:06.090
I...

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:08.140
I'm sorry!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.900
Poopie!

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:30.460
Poopie?!

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:48.700
Caw-haw, caw-haw...

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.790
Rock Lee aspires to become a great ninja,

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.000
even though he cannot use ninjutsu.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.540
He has a long, hard road ahead.

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:06.810
"To become a great ninja,

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:08.190
even though I cannot use ninjutsu."

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:09.760
That is Rock Lee's goal in life,

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:12.100
and he trains hard every day 
as he works to achieve it.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.510
Caw-haw, caw-haw...

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.490
I came here because you said you
had a new training method.

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:17.660
What is this supposed to do?

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:20.790
I thought I'd try to 
master a new ability...

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:22.600
Well, count me out.

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:25.070
You'd really be better off if you 
could use ninjutsu, you know that?

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.950
If I really wanted to,

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.910
I bet I could do something 
similar to Naruto's...

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.910
Transformation, or Shadow Clone Jutsu.

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:33.580
But regardless,

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:36.260
I want to achieve my dream 
of becoming a great ninja,

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:39.510
despite the fact that 
I cannot use ninjutsu!

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:41.710
Lee! Neji!

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.800
We've got a new mission!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:56.230
<b>Rock Lee's</b>

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:56.230
<b>Rival is Naruto</b>

00:13:56.250 --> 00:14:02.110
<b>No. 1 with celebs!</b>

00:13:56.250 --> 00:14:02.110
<b>Gourmet Treat</b>

00:13:56.250 --> 00:14:02.110
<b>Baumkuchen</b>

00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:58.110
Baumkuchen?

00:13:58.110 --> 00:13:59.050
Yup.

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:02.110
Our client today is some rich old lady.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:04.320
<b>Baumkuchen Baking is In Progress</b>

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:05.470
She said, "It's a really popular 
cake they sell in the village,

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:07.600
but they limit the supply 
to only fifty a day,

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:10.120
<b>Only 50 Available</b>

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:10.120
so I want you to get one for me."

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.750
How is that a mission for ninja?

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:16.150
No, every mission is a trial in some way.

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:18.000
We'll do our best like always!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.330
How long are you gonna do that?!

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.250
Caw-haw, caw-haw...

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.940
Look at this crowd!

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:25.920
<b>Nenkinya Baumkuchen 
Only 50 available!</b>

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:25.920
<b>Come early!</b>

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:25.920
<b>Leaf Department Store</b>

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:28.150
Only fifty baumkuchen 
cakes available daily!

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:30.640
<b>Line ends here.</b>

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:31.110
We've only got one voucher 
left, act fast folks!

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:32.520
That's the last one!

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:33.510
Hurry!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.640
Sir, I'll take that ticket!

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:37.020
Give it here!

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:40.150
Naruto!

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:40.150
Bushy-Brows!

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:44.090
For those not aware,
this is Naruto Uzumaki.

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:46.610
Though he can be a bit 
of a dunce at times,

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:49.200
he is a man whose determination and 
hot-bloodedness rival Lee himself!

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:52.180
But above all, he is simply 
a very strong ninja!

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:53.960
And, as we all know,

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:56.620
he's also the main character 
of the main Naruto TV show.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.070
You're buying one, Naruto?

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:00.450
Yeah, I'm on a mission.

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:03.040
Bushy-Brows, are you here 
for a baumkuchen, too?

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.380
Yes, actually.

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:08.170
<i>I'm sure Naruto really 
needs the last voucher.</i>

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.880
<i>I wish I could step aside 
and let him take it, but...</i>

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:14.390
<i>He's a nice guy, normally 
I'd give it to him, but...</i>

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:17.780
<i>I'm on a mission, I can't let him take it!</i>

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:19.730
Well? Who's taking the voucher?

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.570
I am!

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:24.740
I'm sorry, Naruto, 
I have to get one of these!

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:26.280
Same here.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.310
So neither one of us can 
afford to give it up.

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:31.160
We'll have to settle this 
the old-fashioned way.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.870
Caw-haw, caw-haw...

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:36.870
The rules are simple, Naruto.

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:41.540
Whoever grabs the voucher 
first is the winner.

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:43.420
Works for me.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:46.850
Lee, you know what he's capable of!

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:48.270
He's kind of a dimwit, and a 
scatterbrain, and a little clumsy...

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:49.850
...and a butthead, and cheap, 
and perverted, and greedy...

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:51.410
...and egotistical, and oblivious, and a dork,

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.390
but you can't let your guard down!

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:54.180
What's your freakin' problem?!

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:56.260
Say that again, I dare you!

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:56.260
Of course!

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:00.590
He's not someone you can beat 
without proper training.

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:02.440
That's not exactly what 
I was talking about...

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:02.440
Another bowl!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:07.360
And his ninjutsu is at a much higher level
than an ordinary ninja's would be.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.320
That was just sleight of hand!

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.970
Plus he's fought against
many dangerous opponents,

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:14.410
and always come out the victor!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:16.010
None of this ever happened!

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:17.660
At least keep things in-universe!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.790
Caw-haw, caw-haw...

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:21.530
On your mark...

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:22.880
Get set...

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:23.580
Go!

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:26.360
He who strikes first wins!

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:27.380
I won't lose to you!

00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:33.090
Naruto, luck is just 
another type of strength!

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:35.260
Sexy Jutsu!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:38.340
For those not aware,

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:42.230
the "Sexy Jutsu" is one of
Naruto's most effective moves!

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:48.980
I knew it, Naruto's ninjutsu 
skills give him the advantage!

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:51.820
Isn't the real problem that 
Lee's just being a lecher?

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:54.030
I'm not lecherous!

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:57.660
If anything, it was because I'm the type
of man who lives by his instincts!

00:16:57.880 --> 00:17:00.000
Don't try to save face now!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.350
And stop twirling!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:07.460
Thanks for giving me the lead!

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:11.670
I'll just have to counter with 
my own Sexy Jutsu...

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:15.010
Can he really copy the move 
after only seeing it once?

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:19.070
You just changed into a bikini!

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:21.100
I think most guys would 
be floored by this.

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:24.520
Lee, how long have you 
had that swimsuit on?!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.190
That's what bothers you?!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:29.610
Not bad, Bushy-Brows...

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:31.780
Oh, god, not you, too!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.190
No, I was just trying to make a big jump,

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:35.650
and there was a branch in the way.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:38.600
That's just you being scatterbrained!

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:41.370
Now's my chance to mount a comeback!

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:42.830
Crap!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.290
Let's do this!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.570
For those not aware,

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:48.720
this another of Naruto's trademark moves,

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:50.090
the Shadow Clone Jutsu.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.670
Basically, he makes copies of himself.

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:53.370
What's the point?

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:54.610
He just cloned himself.

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:56.720
That's not going to help him win a race.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.980
I won't be outdone!

00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:00.300
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.870
A clone jutsu?

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:04.520
When did Lee—

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:08.860
You're just running so fast 
you're leaving afterimages!

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:10.690
You don't need clones 
any more than he does!

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.190
<i>Of course! If I combine the two...</i>

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:15.570
Harem Jutsu!

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.410
What terrifying power...

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.770
How does knocking out Neji help anyone?!

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:24.870
You know, I'm getting tired of 
playing the straight man here.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.420
Rasengan!

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:30.550
I won't let you win!

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.960
It's mine.

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:41.100
I win, Bushy-Brows!

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:43.930
To the victor goes the voucher!

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.300
<i>I knew it, Naruto is so strong!</i>

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:49.770
<i>I guess I have no choice 
but to give up...</i>

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:56.570
<i>No. If I quit now... If I quit now...</i>

00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:00.450
There, there...

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:02.440
Why am I doing this?

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:04.800
Don't give up, Nejiko.

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:07.360
But I can't figure out this problem...

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:09.480
That's no reason to stop trying.

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:11.680
Keep working hard until 
you solve it, okay?

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:12.970
Okay...

00:19:12.970 --> 00:19:16.090
<i>She's such a good daughter,</i>

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:19.130
<i>but her one flaw is how she's 
so quick to give up.</i>

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:19.110
<b>Oranges</b>

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:22.050
<i>I wonder where she gets it from.</i>

00:19:22.630 --> 00:19:24.510
By the way, Mom,

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:26.410
the girl who sits next 
to me, Sakura,

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:29.540
said she ate some kind of 
cake called a "baumkuchen."

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.160
Oh?

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:33.550
Everyone else in class says 
they've tried it, too.

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:35.950
Ino even said she was 
going to buy one after school!

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:36.970
Oh?

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:38.750
Oh, but I don't want one.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:40.260
We can't afford it, right?

00:19:40.260 --> 00:19:42.160
You already work so hard, Mom.

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:45.590
Nenkinya baumkuchen.

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:48.600
Only fifty baked daily, 5000 yen apiece.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:51.420
I guess high-class department stores 
charge a lot for their food.

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:53.130
We can't afford it.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:20:01.090
<b>Bankbook</b>

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:56.280
I'm sorry, dear.

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:59.100
I was hoping I'd never have 
to spend this money,

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:01.470
but I can't just give up on this.

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:03.680
For her sake.

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:08.310
What in the world is the 
point of this dumb skit?!

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:10.830
This isn't a skit, it's real life.

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:12.580
In what dimension?!

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:15.400
Why did we suddenly go 
into a skit, anyway?!

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:19.580
I wanted to show Naruto just
how badly we need the voucher.

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:21.950
My final tactic, to move him to tears!

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:25.370
This stupid kiddie stuff isn't 
going to change his mind!

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.830
He's bawling!

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:32.330
Bushy-Brows!

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:36.710
I finally understand how 
badly you need the voucher!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:41.480
Take it, it's yours.

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:44.160
Um, that was complete fiction, though...

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.740
Still, I had to resort to ninjustu,

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.010
so I still consider it my loss.

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.520
Naruto...

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:53.930
See ya!

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:56.560
Big...

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:59.680
Naruto's such a big man.

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:02.750
Well, at least you won after all that.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.390
I may have won the voucher,

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:06.490
but as a ninja, and as a man,

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.870
Naruto won, hands down.

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:12.680
Next time, I'll defeat Naruto for real!

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:14.870
Rock Lee aims to become a great ninja...

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.210
...despite not being able to use ninjutsu.

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:21.400
Now he has another ambitious 
dream: to surpass Naruto!

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.010
Caw-haw...

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:25.760
<b>Sold Out</b>

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:25.760
We're all out.

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:28.400
I called voucher number
fifty a bunch of times,

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:29.700
but the holder never showed up!

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:31.570
The baumkuchen...

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:32.460
We failed.

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:34.320
Lee, you idiot!

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:38.350
To defeat Naruto, even though 
he can't use ninjutsu...

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:41.390
he has a long, hard road ahead.

00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:44.450
Caw-haw, caw-haw...

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:22.790
You'd better learn some lessons 
after what happened today!

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:26.510
Why? I did my personal best 
for our first episode.

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:28.270
I have no regrets!

00:23:28.270 --> 00:23:29.930
Are you serious?!

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:31.260
I'll fix you next time...

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:32.440
Speaking of which...

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:35.980
"Love is a Part of the 
Springtime of Youth,"

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:39.730
<b>Love is a Part of the Springtime of Youth
Love Makes Both Sides Crazy</b>

00:23:35.980 --> 00:23:38.610
and "Love Makes Both Sides Crazy,"

00:23:38.610 --> 00:23:39.730
are next week's titles.

00:23:39.730 --> 00:23:41.060
Love and romance...

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:43.770
I always take love and 
romance very seriously!

00:23:43.770 --> 00:23:44.780
Just watch...

00:23:44.780 --> 00:23:46.780
Sakura!

00:23:46.780 --> 00:23:49.090
I have a bad feeling about this...
